  "version": "0.16.0-alpha.2",
  "notes": "> **⚠️ Important notice for users on 0.14.0-alpha.9 – 0.14.0**: these versions have a bug that prevents automatic updates from completing. Please open `https://uniclipboard.app/download` in your browser, download the latest installer, and reinstall manually.\n\n## 0.16.0-alpha.2 - 2026-06-17\n\n### Features\n\n- Add Debug mode and one-click log export in Settings and the command line, making it easier to collect recent logs for support (#1087)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Show an error when General settings fail to save and prevent Windows installer updates from getting stuck while UniClipboard is still running (#1087)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n> **⚠️ 重要公告（0.14.0-alpha.9 ~ 0.14.0 用户）**：这些版本存在自动更新缺陷，点击安装后无法完成更新。请在浏览器中打开 `https://uniclipboard.app/download`，手动下载最新安装包覆盖安装。\n\n## 0.16.0-alpha.2 - 2026-06-17\n\n### Features\n\n- 在设置和命令行中新增 Debug 模式与一键导出日志，方便为支持反馈收集最近日志 (#1087)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 通用设置保存失败时会显示错误提示，并避免 Windows 安装器更新时因 UniClipboard 仍在运行而卡住 (#1087)",
